        <p
          data-en="Live fresh. Feel clean. A small local team cleaning villas in Kuta, Lombok since 2025."
          data-id="Hidup segar. Rasa bersih. Tim lokal kecil yang membersihkan villa di Kuta, Lombok sejak 2025."
        >
          Live fresh. Feel clean. A small local team cleaning villas in Kuta, Lombok since 2025.
        </p>
        <div class="footer-socials">
          <a href="https://wa.me/6287864573925" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="WhatsApp">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.5 14.4l-2.3-1c-.3-.1-.7 0-.9.3l-.9 1.1c-1.5-.7-2.7-1.9-3.4-3.4l1.1-.9c.3-.2.4-.6.3-.9l-1-2.3c-.2-.5-.7-.7-1.2-.5L7.4 7.5c-.5.2-.9.7-.9 1.3.1 4.4 3.6 7.9 8 8 .6 0 1.1-.3 1.3-.9l.5-1.3c.2-.5 0-1-.5-1.2zM12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12c0 1.8.5 3.5 1.3 5L2 22l5.1-1.3c1.5.8 3.1 1.3 4.9 1.3 5.5 0 10-4.5 10-10S17.5 2 12 2z"/></svg>
