          <li><span data-en="Open 08.00–18.00 · every day" data-id="Buka 08.00–18.00 · setiap hari">Open 08.00–18.00 · every day</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <span>© <span id="yr"></span> GoClean Group. <span data-en="All rights reserved." data-id="Semua hak dilindungi.">All rights reserved.</span></span>
      <span data-en="Live fresh. Feel clean." data-id="Hidup segar. Rasa bersih.">Live fresh. Feel clean.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

